447
00:57:04.960 --> 00:57:23.760
Nadine Loepfe: Now, what usually happens if you've been working on a feature for quite a while is that you're so behind, well, you're, of course ahead with your changes, but with everyone else's changes that have been merging, you're behind. So then you're gonna have a merge conflict.

